## Data Fetching (SSR)

### GraphQL Query Export

```tsx
// Component receives data from query
export default function ProductView({ product }: { product: Product }) {
  return (
    <div>
      <h1>{product.name}</h1>
      <p>${product.price}</p>
    </div>
  );
}

export const layout = {
  areaId: 'content',
  sortOrder: 10
};

// Query executed server-side before render
export const query = `
  query GetProduct($slug: String!) {
    product(slug: $slug) {
      productId
      name
      price
    }
  }
`;
```

**How it works:**
1. Route params (`:slug`) auto-passed as variables
2. Query executes on server before render
3. Results passed as props to component
4. Component renders with data

